# Allowlist: this folder holds ~1.8 GB of source data (GitHub rejects files over
# 100 MB and Vercel doesn't need any of it). Only the code and the deployable
# site/ folder are tracked. Data stays local; run_analysis.py regenerates site/.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!run_analysis.py
!regen_naip_hrefs.py
!site/
!site/**
